WEBVTT

00:25:59.500 --> 00:26:01.726
I ended up offering
to help spread the word

00:26:01.750 --> 00:26:03.726
about the sweet taco.

00:26:03.750 --> 00:26:05.934
If I were to line up some friends,

00:26:05.958 --> 00:26:08.018
how many of those
would I need to send here

00:26:08.042 --> 00:26:10.417
before that would earn me
a couple free Cinnabons?

00:26:11.833 --> 00:26:14.726
Anthony: Off the top of my head,
probably like eight people.

00:26:14.750 --> 00:26:16.309
Eight to a dozen people.

00:26:16.333 --> 00:26:21.059
AG: So I promised to recommend it
to 10 friends and ... success!

00:26:21.083 --> 00:26:24.226
Anthony: Yeah, I don't mind
giving a couple away for free,

00:26:24.250 --> 00:26:26.726
yeah, because it's a special request

00:26:26.750 --> 00:26:29.643
and it sounds like a fun experiment to do.

00:26:29.667 --> 00:26:31.768
AG: When I came back 20 minutes later,